cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this alpha software in research, please cite the repository and
  the exact commit you evaluated.
title: OpenCarDueDiligence
type: software
version: 0.1.0-alpha.2
authors:
  - name: OpenCarDueDiligence contributors
abstract: >-
  Evidence-first, bilingual decision-support software for U.S. private-party
  used-car due diligence, inspection, valuation, negotiation, and transaction
  planning. The application is alpha software; separate repository paths and
  data assets may use licenses other than the main AGPL license.
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/haoran-wu/OpenCarDueDiligence
keywords:
  - used cars
  - due diligence
  - vehicle inspection
  - OBD-II
  - evidence provenance
  - decision support
